     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>The sun was shining on the sea, shining with all its might.
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>And this was very odd because it was the middle of the night.
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>The moon was up there sulkily because she thought the sunhad no business to be there after the day was done.
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>“It’s very rude of him,” she said, “to come and spoil the fun.”
